sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AC as account-service (producer)
    participant K as Kafka (topic debit-card-payments)
    participant C as DebitCardPaymentEventConsumer
    participant U as RecordMovementUseCase
    participant P as MovementPersistencePort
    participant M as MongoDB

    AC->>K: publica DebitCardPaymentEvent{accountId, cardId, amount, timestamp}
    K->>C: consume (@KafkaListener groupId=transaction-service)
    C->>C: deserializa evento
    C->>U: execute(movement WITHDRAWAL, ProductType.ACCOUNT)
    U->>P: save(movement)
    P->>M: save
    M-->>P: document
    P-->>U: Movement
    U-->>C: ok
